  "verificationScope": "# ACTUAL Ext boundary and constructed injective cocycle in EVERY degree\n\nLET A be an abelian category with native Ext,S=(A0->B0->E0) an ACTUAL\nshort exact sequence,N any coefficient,I ANY injective resolution of N,\nq ANY nonnegative integer,and a an ACTUAL q-cocycle Hom(A0[0],I).\nTHEN CONSTRUCT b of degree q and c a degree(q+1)cocycle such that\n f*b=a, d(b)=g*c, Ext.delta_S^q([a]_I)=[c]_I.\nThe brackets are EXACTLY native I.extEquivCohomologyClass.symm(mk -).\nThere is NO lift,class-identity,cone-comparison,global-projectivity or\nsource-acyclicity premise in the FINAL existence theorem.\n\nThe underlying lift exists in EVERY integer degree whenever K^q is\ninjective. Prove the actual cocycle composition and its shifted-Hom\nidentity. Prove H(c alpha)=(-1)^q H(fst a) on the SAME native cone.\nThe native triangle third map is MINUS fst;the corresponding factor is\n(-1)^(q+1),EXACTLY the native contravariant Ext.delta convention.\nRetain actual inverse Q(alpha),inverse Q(I.iota),all shifted composition\nisomorphisms and target-degree transport. Do not replace a derived\nidentity by an affine module-Ext assertion.\n\n9 declarations:8 ordinary theorems and1 CONSTRUCTED cocycle product\n(NOT a proof).7individually compiled roots,309physical rootlines,\n10closed project modules. All9full imported types,1construction body,\nsemantic roles and standard axiom closures manually read. Only propext,\nClassical.choice,Quot.sound. ALL3nonroot modules byte-match the earlier\nPUBLIC short-exact-roof archive.7native reference sources match pinned\nmathlib Git bytes after LF. Independent online documentation inspected.\n\nThis closes the GENERIC all-degree native connecting-map/cocycle bridge.\nOPEN:SAME arbitrary-r ORIGINAL ordered Koszul epsilon,source iterations,\nits full original degree signs,actual a|S formula,geometric target/frame\nspecialization,global-to-local isomorphism,proper-duality/canonical-theta,\nambient twist and UNIFORM fixed m. Gener